-Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg/1280px-Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 1280, "height": 960, "srcset": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg/3840px-Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Model_of_the_Igueriben_Position_02.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=107355886", "sha1": "625a49fb1807bcd5ebdbcad0afce274507fbcf22", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2021-07-08 22:26:08", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "Model of the Igueriben Position 02", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "Siege of Igueriben|Self-published work|Dioramas in Spain|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation|Photos by User:Dcapillae|2021 events in Málaga|Dioramas of the Rif War", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "GPSLatitude": {"value": "36.713373", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "GPSLongitude": {"value": "-4.429724", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "GPSMapDatum": {"value": "WGS-84", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Maqueta de la posición de Igueriben, con defensores y atacantes en acción, exhibida en la exposición <i>La epopeya de Igueriben: Marruecos 1921</i> organizada por la asociación histórico-cultural Torrijos 1831 entre los días 1 y 20 julio de 2021 en el Centro de Interpretación Torrijos, en Málaga, España, con motivo del centenario del <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/es:Desastre_de_Annual\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:es:Desastre de Annual\">desastre de Annual</a>. La maqueta muestra la posición de Igueriben con los soldados españoles abriendo fuego desde distintas ubicaciones defendiendo la posición de un ataque rifeño. Se observa  la alambrada y el parapeto de piedra que rodea todo el perímetro, las tiendas de campaña y demás elementos de la posición. A la derecha de la imagen, el camino de entrada a la posición cerrado con una barrera de estacas. Autores: Juan Fernández Sastre y Esteban Alcántara Alcaide.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2021-07-08 18:16:02", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Dcapillae\" title=\"User:Dcapillae\">Daniel Capilla</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Attribution": {"value": "Daniel Capilla", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc-by-sa-4.0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}, "mime": "im